MODULE: ReadyCheckpointSkips
TARGET: CheckpointHeld
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: Persist consumed offsets above an unresolved prepare instead of holding its floor
PERTURBS: Checkpoint

--- FIND
    /\ ckpt' = [ckpt EXCEPT ![c] = [p \in Keys |-> Floor(c,p)]]
--- REPLACE
    /\ ckpt' = [ckpt EXCEPT ![c] = read[c]]
--- END
